        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ea34eef2-72fb-531b-b388-290c98530016",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Criss Angel, Christopher Nicholas Sarantakos\n- Shows: Criss Angel Mindfreak, Criss Angel Believe, Mindfreak LIVE\n- Organizations: Cirque du Soleil\n- Places: Luxor Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada, Las Vegas\n- Topics: tourist revenue\n\nFacts:\n- Christopher Nicholas Sarantakos was born on December 19, 1967, and is known by the stage name Criss Angel.\n- Criss Angel is an American magician, illusionist, and musician.\n- Criss Angel is known for starring in the television and stage show \"Criss Angel Mindfreak.\"\n- Criss Angel previously performed in the live illusion show \"Criss Angel Believe\" in collaboration with Cirque du Soleil at the Luxor casino in Las Vegas.\n- In 2010, \"Criss Angel Believe\" generated $150 million in tourist revenue for Las Vegas.\n- On May 11, 2016, \"Criss Angel Believe\" was replaced by \"Mindfreak LIVE.\"\n- \"Mindfreak LIVE\" is partly produced by Cirque du Soleil, but Criss Angel holds the directive rights entirely.\n- Luxor Las Vegas is a hotel and casino on the southern end of the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "7a3bf69e-18fa-57bf-82f9-153a07d9d718",
        "text": "Page: Criss Angel. Sentence: Christopher Nicholas Sarantakos (born December 19, 1967), known by the stage name Criss Angel, is an American magician, illusionist and musician.\nPage: Criss Angel. Sentence: He is known for starring in the television and stage show \"Criss Angel Mindfreak\" and his previous live performance illusion show \"Criss Angel Believe\" in collaboration with \"Cirque du Soleil\" at the Luxor casino in Las Vegas.\nPage: Criss Angel. Sentence: The show generated $150 million in tourist revenue to Las Vegas in 2010, but has since been replaced by \"Mindfreak LIVE\" on 11 May 2016 (the show is partly produced by Cirque, however the directive rights are entirely with Criss Angel).\nPage: Luxor Las Vegas. Sentence: Luxor Las Vegas is a hotel and casino situated on the southern end of the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada.",
